  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project. Moldova&apos;s considerable external debt constitutes a major impediment to economic growth and poverty alleviateion. Sida supports Moldova&apos;s strivings for debt restructuring by providing an advisor in debt negotiations. This project aims at raising the capacity of the Moldovan Ministry of Finance in debt management.</narrative>
